+	depends on ARCH_SUNXI || COMPILE_TEST
+	depends on CPU_FREQ
+	select PM_OPP
+	help
+	  This adds a devfreq driver for the DynamIQ Shared Unit (L3 cache
+	  and snoop filter) of the Allwinner A733. The DSU runs at 75 % of
+	  the fastest core, capped at the highest point the A55 cluster's
+	  voltage already covers, through a governor of its own; its voltage
